    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest... i guess that's all i want. but everything feels so disconnected. it's like my soul left when he did, and i'm just this shell stuck in a world that doesn't make sense anymore. if the only reason i'm here was because of us, what's the point of staying if that's gone?",
